BT /F1 10.15 Tf 0.08 0.15 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 50 582.0 Tm (The absence of journalling can reduce write amplification under some workloads but is not) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.15 Tf 0.08 0.15 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 50 565.0 Tm (equivalent to crash resilience. An ext2 disk may use extensions affecting directory) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.15 Tf 0.08 0.15 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 50 548.0 Tm (structure or inode layout; the term EXT2 is not permission to ignore the feature masks.) Tj ET
